+/// Adapt a program that draws for a dark terminal to a light background. Every
+/// explicit cell color (palette or RGB) has its lightness mirrored, keeping
+/// hue and chroma, so light text turns dark and dark highlight backgrounds turn
+/// pale. The default foreground and background are left as configured.
+///
+/// Meant for running every program in its dark theme and letting the terminal
+/// follow a light theme. Pair it with a dark `palette`/`theme` and a light
+/// `background`/`foreground`.
+@"adapt-dark-colors": bool = false,
+
